    <h2>Power BI Projects</h2>
    
    <h3>HR Employee Attrition Dashboard</h3>
    <p><strong>Project Overview:</strong> Interactive dashboard analyzing employee turnover patterns to help HR identify retention risks. Key metrics include attrition rate, breakdowns by department, age group, job role, salary slab, years at company, job satisfaction, and more. Built using Power BI with DAX measures for dynamic calculations.</p>
    <p><strong>Tools:</strong> Power BI, DAX, Power Query</p>
    <p><strong>Key Insights:</strong> [Add 2-3 bullet points from your dashboard, e.g., "Highest attrition in Sales & R&D departments", "Employees with low job satisfaction and longer years since promotion are more likely to leave"]</p>
    
